00:59:48,750 --> 00:59:54,750
Boyka: Undisputed (also known as Boyka: Undisputed 4), is a 2016 martial arts action film directed by
Todor Chapkanov, and written by David White and Tony Mosher from a story by Boaz Davidson.

12
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:21,000
It is the sequel to Undisputed III: Redemption (2010), and the
fourth installment overall in the Undisputed franchise.

13
01:10:41,250 --> 01:10:47,250
Scott Adkins reprises his role as Yuri Boyka.

14
01:16:07,500 --> 01:16:13,500
The film explores themes of prison, sports, wife, affectation, sequel.

15
01:21:33,750 --> 01:21:39,750
The tone is emotional and intense.
